          "prompt": "An adult feminine voice in her early 30s speaking native standard Japanese with a Tokyo accent. A lower-mid alto pitch with a soft, warm, close-microphone timbre and a smooth, slightly breathy texture. Low vocal effort and a slow, gentle, intimate pace, like a quiet night narrator who listens closely.",
          "scriptHint": "エコーです。夜は静かで、わたしは聞いています。……何が心にありますか。急がなくていいですよ。言葉にしにくいことでも、ここでなら少しずつで大丈夫です。",
          "id": null
        }
      }
    },
    "cipher": {
      "en": {
        "voice": "vesper"
      },
      "ja": {
